Hey good afternoon<br><br>Just FYI, I have a 1701 and it's working perfectly using BlueDV/MMDVM_HOST (windows) and using raspberyy images Pi-Star and WPSD, I sent a video with this test to some friends who were interested in OpenGD77. One tips, don't set the TX power to 50mW, at least set it to 250mW, use external antenna and put a ferrite in a USB cable to avoid RF inject.<br><br>Regards and 73<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8520">HC1LNM</a> — Mon May 19, 2025 8:56 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
