Updating this post to report that the problem was caused to a faulty radio.<br>That 1701 for some reason doesn't like to work in Hotspot mode.I tested on another 1701 and the second one works fine!<br><br>I tried changing the calibration in both radio and hotspot but did not make any difference, the communication is received fine and audio is clear in the first 3 to 5 seconds than it starts becoming broken and garbled. If I hit PTT audio seems to sync and comes back clear, but after couple seconds it breaks up again.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7412">K4BMI</a> — Mon Jan 20, 2025 6:32 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
